(5553922, 803362, 99708, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming the lines in the bg are from your computer or a print out.  I do the like the lighting, color, and composition.</td>', 'I''m assuming the lines in the bg are from your computer or a print out.  I do the like the lighting, color, and composition.', '2009-07-01 16:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5553929, 803558, 99708, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to find where and how this meets the challenge.  Beyond that, there is too much going on in the picture, no focal point.</td>', 'I''m trying to find where and how this meets the challenge.  Beyond that, there is too much going on in the picture, no focal point.', '2009-07-01 16:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5553940, 803057, 99708, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  Dr. Suess at his best.   That should be a new challenge - Dr. Suess.  Sorry, back to your picture.  The angle, lighting, and reflection are all beautiful.  The green was a smart contrast to the SPAM can.   10</td>', 'Sweet!  Dr. Suess at his best.   That should be a new challenge - Dr. Suess.  Sorry, back to your picture.  The angle, lighting, and reflection are all beautiful.  The green was a smart contrast to the SPAM can.   10', '2009-07-01 17:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5553947, 803011, 99708, '<td valign="top">IMO DNMC.</td>', 'IMO DNMC.', '2009-07-01 17:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5553998, 802358, 43774, '<td valign="top">Oh boy this is creative! I am regretting entering now because of all of the excellent photos I am seeing! Fantastic job.<br/> <br/>I''ve voted on them all and this is my top pick.....I am sure you will win a ribbon for this!</td>', 'Oh boy this is creative! I am regretting entering now because of all of the excellent photos I am seeing! Fantastic job. I''ve voted on them all and this is my top pick.....I am sure you will win a ribbon for this!', '2009-07-01 17:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554000, 803238, 43774, '<td valign="top">It actually looks good!! Not that I would ever eat Spam, but great job for making it look edible.<br/> <br/>In my top 3.<br/>A very good photo, nothing wrong with this at all.</td>', 'It actually looks good!! Not that I would ever eat Spam, but great job for making it look edible. In my top 3.A very good photo, nothing wrong with this at all.', '2009-07-01 17:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554001, 803538, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love the DOF. Great job on the photo, you''ve made Spam look good! In my top 3.</td>', 'Love the DOF. Great job on the photo, you''ve made Spam look good! In my top 3.', '2009-07-01 17:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554265, 802921, 85310, '<td valign="top">A nice in flight picture, although I never would have figured out the nose art without the photo caption.</td>', 'A nice in flight picture, although I never would have figured out the nose art without the photo caption.', '2009-07-01 18:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554275, 803373, 85310, '<td valign="top">I find the background detracts from the image, especially the dark spot in the middle of the upper edge.</td>', 'I find the background detracts from the image, especially the dark spot in the middle of the upper edge.', '2009-07-01 18:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554293, 803154, 85310, '<td valign="top">I''m undecided as to whether the tile backsplash underneath the cupboards adds or detracts to the image. I do find the keystoning of the cupboard a little disturbing, but I''m somewhat anal that way ... ;-)  The concept is amsuing, though.</td>', 'I''m undecided as to whether the tile backsplash underneath the cupboards adds or detracts to the image. I do find the keystoning of the cupboard a little disturbing, but I''m somewhat anal that way ... ;-)  The concept is amsuing, though.', '2009-07-01 18:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554298, 803539, 85310, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the challenge. It might work better if they weren''t blank envelopes. There may be a little too much dead space (open carpet) at lower right.</td>', 'An interesting take on the challenge. It might work better if they weren''t blank envelopes. There may be a little too much dead space (open carpet) at lower right.', '2009-07-01 18:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554306, 803011, 86848, '<td valign="top">Not sure I see the connection with spam...<br/> <br/>For firework shots it can yield better shots if you focus close to infinity and also use a tripod.  It might just be the firework, but it seems jittery and out of focus.</td>', 'Not sure I see the connection with spam... For firework shots it can yield better shots if you focus close to infinity and also use a tripod.  It might just be the firework, but it seems jittery and out of focus.', '2009-07-01 18:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554313, 801828, 85310, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, I don''t see how this fits into the "SPAM" theme. It''s unfortunate that the dog has a horse "growing out" of his head. The composition seems a little unbalanced (heavy on the right).</td>', 'Unfortunately, I don''t see how this fits into the "SPAM" theme. It''s unfortunate that the dog has a horse "growing out" of his head. The composition seems a little unbalanced (heavy on the right).', '2009-07-01 18:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554335, 803163, 86848, '<td valign="top">I like the concept.  Appear to be some blown highlights on the top of the can.  My personal preference would also be to keep the forground completely in focus with the blur only being in the background.</td>', 'I like the concept.  Appear to be some blown highlights on the top of the can.  My personal preference would also be to keep the forground completely in focus with the blur only being in the background.', '2009-07-01 18:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554336, 803196, 85310, '<td valign="top">{chuckle} An original idea---I like it. However, the highlights are a little harsh on this one; I find my eye drawn to the bars and away from the SPAM dinner setting. This same concept might work better if we didn''t actually see the bars, but only saw their shadow outline on the table.</td>', '{chuckle} An original idea---I like it. However, the highlights are a little harsh on this one; I find my eye drawn to the bars and away from the SPAM dinner setting. This same concept might work better if we didn''t actually see the bars, but only saw their shadow outline on the table.', '2009-07-01 18:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554356, 803464, 85310, '<td valign="top">The framing of the image seems a little off. There seems to be a little too much black at right and not quite enough at bottom. The can itself seems just a little underexposed, but I appreciate the challenges posed by the wide dynamic range of the scene you are trying to capture.</td>', 'The framing of the image seems a little off. There seems to be a little too much black at right and not quite enough at bottom. The can itself seems just a little underexposed, but I appreciate the challenges posed by the wide dynamic range of the scene you are trying to capture.', '2009-07-01 19:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554360, 803493, 86848, '<td valign="top">Now thats just NASTY!  :)<br/> <br/>Great concept and a wonderful way to pull someone into the image.  Shot strikes me as a little flat and could benefit from more side lighting.  Is the reflection in the top of the bottle the camera and on-board flash?</td>', 'Now thats just NASTY!  :) Great concept and a wonderful way to pull someone into the image.  Shot strikes me as a little flat and could benefit from more side lighting.  Is the reflection in the top of the bottle the camera and on-board flash?', '2009-07-01 19:02:36.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5554365, 803289, 86848, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting in this shot.  Good concept and meets the challenge well.  Question is, what are you having for dinner with all that spam around?</td>', 'I like the lighting in this shot.  Good concept and meets the challenge well.  Question is, what are you having for dinner with all that spam around?', '2009-07-01 19:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554369, 802886, 86848, '<td valign="top">Nice effect and concept.  You pulled it off well.  Lighting is nice.  Although you are catering to the environmentalist, do we really want spam recycled?  :)</td>', 'Nice effect and concept.  You pulled it off well.  Lighting is nice.  Although you are catering to the environmentalist, do we really want spam recycled?  :)', '2009-07-01 19:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554373, 801791, 86848, '<td valign="top">Shot seems a little out of focus.  Also don''t see the connection with spam.  Oh, wait, thats where spam comes from?  POOR BONNIE!  ;)  JK.</td>', 'Shot seems a little out of focus.  Also don''t see the connection with spam.  Oh, wait, thats where spam comes from?  POOR BONNIE!  ;)  JK.', '2009-07-01 19:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554381, 803285, 85310, '<td valign="top">Ah water droplets and splashes. Now, if only you''d managed to do this with an oversaturated sunset in the background, then you might have had something ... ;-)</td>', 'Ah water droplets and splashes. Now, if only you''d managed to do this with an oversaturated sunset in the background, then you might have had something ... ;-)', '2009-07-01 19:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554382, 803590, 86848, '<td valign="top">Cute!  The SpamCam.  Nice concept and meats the challenge well.  ;)  I like the lighting.  Personal preference would have the bag all in focus.</td>', 'Cute!  The SpamCam.  Nice concept and meats the challenge well.  ;)  I like the lighting.  Personal preference would have the bag all in focus.', '2009-07-01 19:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554389, 803122, 86848, '<td valign="top">Wow, some people could use therapy.  ;)  Nice idea.  Not sure that high key was the best choice here.  Seem to be a lot of blown highlights.  Might also have turned the bowl to hide the seam.</td>', 'Wow, some people could use therapy.  ;)  Nice idea.  Not sure that high key was the best choice here.  Seem to be a lot of blown highlights.  Might also have turned the bowl to hide the seam.', '2009-07-01 19:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554394, 803241, 86848, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a bit flat.  Although a bib is appropriate these days.  :)</td>', 'Lighting is a bit flat.  Although a bib is appropriate these days.  :)', '2009-07-01 19:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554395, 803238, 85310, '<td valign="top">Very nice, it actually looks appetizing and (almost) edible. ;-)</td>', 'Very nice, it actually looks appetizing and (almost) edible. ;-)', '2009-07-01 19:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554396, 803057, 85310, '<td valign="top">A nice idea, but the tilt doesn''t work for me. (It fails the basic test ... I tilt my head to try to straighten the image up.)</td>', 'A nice idea, but the tilt doesn''t work for me. (It fails the basic test ... I tilt my head to try to straighten the image up.)', '2009-07-01 19:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554397, 803496, 85310, '<td valign="top">I think this would be better with a somewhat stronger fill light from the right hand side.</td>', 'I think this would be better with a somewhat stronger fill light from the right hand side.', '2009-07-01 19:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554398, 803561, 85310, '<td valign="top">A very nice image, but a bit of a shoehorn for the challenge topic.</td>', 'A very nice image, but a bit of a shoehorn for the challenge topic.', '2009-07-01 19:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554399, 803491, 85310, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea, but I think the depth of field needs to be a bit wider here, as the "Monty Python" portion of the label is already rather soft, and it is needed for the image to make sense. The lighting also seems a little dull.</td>', 'An interesting idea, but I think the depth of field needs to be a bit wider here, as the "Monty Python" portion of the label is already rather soft, and it is needed for the image to make sense. The lighting also seems a little dull.', '2009-07-01 19:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554401, 803382, 85310, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea, but I''m not certain what is gained by using the negative/inverted colours.</td>', 'An interesting idea, but I''m not certain what is gained by using the negative/inverted colours.', '2009-07-01 19:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554402, 803044, 85310, '<td valign="top">The blurry keys and slight reflectivity of the surface detract from this image. Compositionally, I''m not sure the SPAM keys works square on to the camera, I might have tried a variety of slightly oblique angles. All that said, and interesting idea.</td>', 'The blurry keys and slight reflectivity of the surface detract from this image. Compositionally, I''m not sure the SPAM keys works square on to the camera, I might have tried a variety of slightly oblique angles. All that said, and interesting idea.', '2009-07-01 19:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554403, 803442, 85310, '<td valign="top">A little soft on the squirrels tail. Compositionally, it seems a little snapshot-like.</td>', 'A little soft on the squirrels tail. Compositionally, it seems a little snapshot-like.', '2009-07-01 19:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554404, 801791, 85310, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm ... I''m not sure the connection with Spam is immediately obvious ... was this an erroneous submission? Or an attempt for the brown ribbon?</td>', 'Hmmmm ... I''m not sure the connection with Spam is immediately obvious ... was this an erroneous submission? Or an attempt for the brown ribbon?', '2009-07-01 19:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554415, 803362, 85310, '<td valign="top">Ah yes, this cliche. Just missing the water drop and the sunset. ;-)<br/> <br/>Seriously, though, it would be nice if at least one of the lines of text was actually legible.</td>', 'Ah yes, this cliche. Just missing the water drop and the sunset. ;-) Seriously, though, it would be nice if at least one of the lines of text was actually legible.', '2009-07-01 19:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
