(5556748, 801791, 73564, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m not getting the couple dog pictures I''ve seen in this challenge. The other image I looked in it for an eaten can of spam, didn''t find one, and I don''t see one here. I was thinking seeing this second dog picture that, IS this supposed to be some "spam" for this challenge, because it has no "spam" in it?? <br/>LOL..it''s confusing...<br/> <br/>The quality of this image is great, the comp is great..colors are good. Hate to score a great image so low for not IMO, portraying "SPAM". 5</td>', 'Maybe I''m not getting the couple dog pictures I''ve seen in this challenge. The other image I looked in it for an eaten can of spam, didn''t find one, and I don''t see one here. I was thinking seeing this second dog picture that, IS this supposed to be some "spam" for this challenge, because it has no "spam" in it?? LOL..it''s confusing... The quality of this image is great, the comp is great..colors are good. Hate to score a great image so low for not IMO, portraying "SPAM". 5', '2009-07-02 22:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
