(5556789, 803166, 73564, '<td valign="top">NICE...great quality. I''m not a huge star trek fan, but this is creative. 10<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=736879" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/70000-74999/73564/120/736879.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/70000-74999/73564/120/736879.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/70000-74999/73564/120/736879.jpg"/></a></td>', 'NICE...great quality. I''m not a huge star trek fan, but this is creative. 10 ', '2009-07-02 22:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556849, 803461, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea. Shot is a bit too soft IMO.</td>', 'Very creative idea. Shot is a bit too soft IMO.', '2009-07-02 22:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556851, 803098, 77196, '<td valign="top">Does SPAM represent the death part of the still life? Nice shot.</td>', 'Does SPAM represent the death part of the still life? Nice shot.', '2009-07-02 22:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556852, 803247, 77196, '<td valign="top">Tell the truth - this was shot for Something Never Seen on DPC, wasn''t it? Nice exposure, interesting expression (not usually a fan of "tonsil shots"), and animated hands. I wouldn''t relate this to SPAM without the title, though.</td>', 'Tell the truth - this was shot for Something Never Seen on DPC, wasn''t it? Nice exposure, interesting expression (not usually a fan of "tonsil shots"), and animated hands. I wouldn''t relate this to SPAM without the title, though.', '2009-07-02 22:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556854, 803285, 77196, '<td valign="top">LOL. Nice splash capture.</td>', 'LOL. Nice splash capture.', '2009-07-02 22:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556857, 803539, 77196, '<td valign="top">For me, the unused envelopes as props don''t quite cut it. The laptop is a bit hard to see. Creative idea, though.</td>', 'For me, the unused envelopes as props don''t quite cut it. The laptop is a bit hard to see. Creative idea, though.', '2009-07-02 22:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556861, 803166, 77196, '<td valign="top">I bet he was thankful he didn''t have to eat it! The SPAM almost looks like a flattened hair ball!</td>', 'I bet he was thankful he didn''t have to eat it! The SPAM almost looks like a flattened hair ball!', '2009-07-02 22:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556867, 802541, 77196, '<td valign="top">The worms look obscene! Am I seeing right that the worm has supposedly melted a hold through the envelope? <br/>Somehow the lighting on this is off IMO - not that it is bad, but I''m not sure about what you''ve chosen to highlight... I think it is related to the mood of the picture (with the lighting) seems to conflict with the content of the picture. The shot almost feels menacing, but the lighting says "cheerful and OK" - if that makes any sense.</td>', 'The worms look obscene! Am I seeing right that the worm has supposedly melted a hold through the envelope? Somehow the lighting on this is off IMO - not that it is bad, but I''m not sure about what you''ve chosen to highlight... I think it is related to the mood of the picture (with the lighting) seems to conflict with the content of the picture. The shot almost feels menacing, but the lighting says "cheerful and OK" - if that makes any sense.', '2009-07-02 22:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556873, 801828, 77196, '<td valign="top">No idea how this fits the challenge. I find it distracting that the dog is looking off frame, and that its head blends with the cows in the background.</td>', 'No idea how this fits the challenge. I find it distracting that the dog is looking off frame, and that its head blends with the cows in the background.', '2009-07-02 22:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556874, 803443, 77196, '<td valign="top">Much less take a picture of its signage! Great idea, and well executed.</td>', 'Much less take a picture of its signage! Great idea, and well executed.', '2009-07-02 22:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556876, 802060, 77196, '<td valign="top">389? Posh! That''s only a days worth for some... Nice clear screen shot.</td>', '389? Posh! That''s only a days worth for some... Nice clear screen shot.', '2009-07-02 23:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556878, 803558, 77196, '<td valign="top">A bit busy, and not terribly clear how it relates to SPAM (billboard clutter?).</td>', 'A bit busy, and not terribly clear how it relates to SPAM (billboard clutter?).', '2009-07-02 23:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556881, 803496, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very cute idea. Nice execution (excuse the choice of words). Looks like there is a tiny bit of anomaly in the white background behind the "mouse". Very nice choice of crop - to get one cat paw mostly in.</td>', 'Very cute idea. Nice execution (excuse the choice of words). Looks like there is a tiny bit of anomaly in the white background behind the "mouse". Very nice choice of crop - to get one cat paw mostly in.', '2009-07-02 23:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556882, 802358, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea, and nicely done.</td>', 'Very creative idea, and nicely done.', '2009-07-02 23:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556886, 803044, 77196, '<td valign="top">Except it is unlocked - letting the SPAM in! Oh NO! <br/>Semi-seriously, the lock needs to be open to make this shot. keys OOF in foreground also add. Far side of the lock front is a bit dark - needs Advanced to change that without changing the rest of the shot.</td>', 'Except it is unlocked - letting the SPAM in! Oh NO! Semi-seriously, the lock needs to be open to make this shot. keys OOF in foreground also add. Far side of the lock front is a bit dark - needs Advanced to change that without changing the rest of the shot.', '2009-07-02 23:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556889, 803241, 77196, '<td valign="top">Cute. Don''t think I''ve ever seen a decoration on a face mask like this, and almost not enough context to make the shot understandable.</td>', 'Cute. Don''t think I''ve ever seen a decoration on a face mask like this, and almost not enough context to make the shot understandable.', '2009-07-02 23:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556892, 801791, 77196, '<td valign="top">A river of SPAM? The soft fur of the dog makes it look OOF. Something feels out of perspective in the shot between the dog and the background (esp. the left side).</td>', 'A river of SPAM? The soft fur of the dog makes it look OOF. Something feels out of perspective in the shot between the dog and the background (esp. the left side).', '2009-07-02 23:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556894, 803610, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wish I could get my hair to do that! Great shot - a cutie.</td>', 'Wish I could get my hair to do that! Great shot - a cutie.', '2009-07-02 23:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556899, 803122, 77196, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. This does not quite carry it off. The SPAM in the jell-o is not obvious enough. I think the clear frosted bowl and white background don''t make a good combination in this case.</td>', 'Hmmm. This does not quite carry it off. The SPAM in the jell-o is not obvious enough. I think the clear frosted bowl and white background don''t make a good combination in this case.', '2009-07-02 23:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556908, 803373, 77196, '<td valign="top">Mr Goat? I hear you like tin cans... <br/>Something about this shot doesn''t work for me - the dark spot in the background is distracting. Also, it is not obvious what the background is, and it blends a bit too well and not well enough with the tablecloth / place mat. It feels to me like elements of the shot are competing rather than blending. <br/>Maybe it is just this simple - I don''t like the combo of the baby blue to white and the dark blue of the can (pastel vs. primary colors).</td>', 'Mr Goat? I hear you like tin cans... Something about this shot doesn''t work for me - the dark spot in the background is distracting. Also, it is not obvious what the background is, and it blends a bit too well and not well enough with the tablecloth / place mat. It feels to me like elements of the shot are competing rather than blending. Maybe it is just this simple - I don''t like the combo of the baby blue to white and the dark blue of the can (pastel vs. primary colors).', '2009-07-02 23:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556912, 803238, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wow! That almost looks good. Nice use of DOF, although I think the glass distracts from the shot (especially being almost diagonal). Might be a bit hot on the center tomato, but that is being pretty picky - it really doesn''t distract from the overall shot.</td>', 'Wow! That almost looks good. Nice use of DOF, although I think the glass distracts from the shot (especially being almost diagonal). Might be a bit hot on the center tomato, but that is being pretty picky - it really doesn''t distract from the overall shot.', '2009-07-02 23:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556920, 803267, 77196, '<td valign="top">Your model''s face is a bit dark, but this makes me laugh! In the thumbnail, it looked like he had an artificial piggy nose on. Very creative idea, and your model has a great pose and expression!</td>', 'Your model''s face is a bit dark, but this makes me laugh! In the thumbnail, it looked like he had an artificial piggy nose on. Very creative idea, and your model has a great pose and expression!', '2009-07-02 23:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556925, 803590, 77196, '<td valign="top">This gets a smile - cute idea, and nicely executed.</td>', 'This gets a smile - cute idea, and nicely executed.', '2009-07-02 23:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556929, 803525, 77196, '<td valign="top">Smiles. Cute idea. Lighting is a bit strong on the front of the mailbox, reflected on the inside of the lid, and on the SPAM can. If you used a flash (and it looks like you did), try backing up a few more steps and using the zoom (or crop). If that is not enough, try a bit different angle on the lid, so it bounces the light away from the lens.</td>', 'Smiles. Cute idea. Lighting is a bit strong on the front of the mailbox, reflected on the inside of the lid, and on the SPAM can. If you used a flash (and it looks like you did), try backing up a few more steps and using the zoom (or crop). If that is not enough, try a bit different angle on the lid, so it bounces the light away from the lens.', '2009-07-02 23:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556932, 802979, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting tilt to shot - I think it adds to the interest. Nice working with shiny surfaces, and lighting.</td>', 'Interesting tilt to shot - I think it adds to the interest. Nice working with shiny surfaces, and lighting.', '2009-07-02 23:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556939, 803154, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like what you''ve tried to do with the diagonal line between the cans and the empty cupboard. However, for me, I think you could''ve gotten the same message across just using 1/2 of the cupboard, and cropping in a lot tighter, making the labels more readable. You''d still have the concept of only two choices in a bare cupboard.</td>', 'I like what you''ve tried to do with the diagonal line between the cans and the empty cupboard. However, for me, I think you could''ve gotten the same message across just using 1/2 of the cupboard, and cropping in a lot tighter, making the labels more readable. You''d still have the concept of only two choices in a bare cupboard.', '2009-07-02 23:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556940, 803011, 77196, '<td valign="top">Exploding SPAM? There''s a new concept. It probably would burn, with all that oil...</td>', 'Exploding SPAM? There''s a new concept. It probably would burn, with all that oil...', '2009-07-02 23:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556942, 803382, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting edit. Great idea. Nice timing. I won''t ask how many cans of SPAM you went through to get the shot...</td>', 'Interesting edit. Great idea. Nice timing. I won''t ask how many cans of SPAM you went through to get the shot...', '2009-07-02 23:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556949, 803163, 77196, '<td valign="top">Mirror mirror - Is my SPAM near? Interesting shot. It feels a bit too yellow to me (at least on the cans, but the shelf / etc. seem to be OK).</td>', 'Mirror mirror - Is my SPAM near? Interesting shot. It feels a bit too yellow to me (at least on the cans, but the shelf / etc. seem to be OK).', '2009-07-02 23:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
