(5556959, 803381, 77196, '<td valign="top">Is that the SPAM bodyguard in the background? Or a member of the SPCS (Society for the Prevention of Cruelty to Spam)? Not sure the fan blades are obviously spam, but they are close enough.</td>', 'Is that the SPAM bodyguard in the background? Or a member of the SPCS (Society for the Prevention of Cruelty to Spam)? Not sure the fan blades are obviously spam, but they are close enough.', '2009-07-02 23:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
