(5560486, 803362, 78371, '<td valign="top">I like the cool tones and the abstract use of spam.  The different blurred out lines of text really make for an interesting pattern. I just think for a stronger composition that the whole glass would be visible or maybe even turn this picture upside down.</td>', 'I like the cool tones and the abstract use of spam.  The different blurred out lines of text really make for an interesting pattern. I just think for a stronger composition that the whole glass would be visible or maybe even turn this picture upside down.', '2009-07-05 14:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5560490, 803011, 78371, '<td valign="top">Are you spamming the spam challenge? Because that would be brilliant. I don''t see the connection with spam which could be my fault. Otherwise, this is an ok shot with a bit of noise.</td>', 'Are you spamming the spam challenge? Because that would be brilliant. I don''t see the connection with spam which could be my fault. Otherwise, this is an ok shot with a bit of noise.', '2009-07-05 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5560494, 801828, 78371, '<td valign="top">The tonal range in this photo is really pretty good. The highlights and the shadows are not blown out. kudos. Saying that, I don''t see spam here. Furthermore, I think that the dog should be in focus.</td>', 'The tonal range in this photo is really pretty good. The highlights and the shadows are not blown out. kudos. Saying that, I don''t see spam here. Furthermore, I think that the dog should be in focus.', '2009-07-05 15:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
