(5560499, 803491, 78371, '<td valign="top">I like that you used the full frame. With this angle reading the text, specifically the song titles, was a bit difficult.</td>', 'I like that you used the full frame. With this angle reading the text, specifically the song titles, was a bit difficult.', '2009-07-05 15:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5560509, 803154, 78371, '<td valign="top">For what the photo is lacking in composition it gains in hilariousness. I didn''t even know that was such a food, good with custard apparently. I think that the photo should have been taken more head on and not included the edge of the cabinet door or the tiling.</td>', 'For what the photo is lacking in composition it gains in hilariousness. I didn''t even know that was such a food, good with custard apparently. I think that the photo should have been taken more head on and not included the edge of the cabinet door or the tiling.', '2009-07-05 15:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
