(5560512, 802359, 78371, '<td valign="top">This is a really cute photo. (I mean that as a compliment.) The bokeh is really nice.  I like how there is a shallow dof but I wish that the spam''s bundle of stuff was more in focus.</td>', 'This is a really cute photo. (I mean that as a compliment.) The bokeh is really nice.  I like how there is a shallow dof but I wish that the spam''s bundle of stuff was more in focus.', '2009-07-05 15:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
