(5560763, 803322, 106233, '<td valign="top">Good shot! Maybe some lateral light could improve the shot adding volume to it (it is a little flat). I dont like the internal border blending with the white background, but thats ok, this is not a big issue.<br/>PS.: I will sue you for copyrights violation!! This ribbon picture is mine!!<br/>=P <br/>just kidding... actually i am glad that you used it!! =D</td>', 'Good shot! Maybe some lateral light could improve the shot adding volume to it (it is a little flat). I dont like the internal border blending with the white background, but thats ok, this is not a big issue.PS.: I will sue you for copyrights violation!! This ribbon picture is mine!!=P just kidding... actually i am glad that you used it!! =D', '2009-07-05 20:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5560764, 803375, 106233, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but there are some distracting elements on the background,,, I like the composition, but maybe i would prefer to frame the entire door of the box...</td>', 'Good idea, but there are some distracting elements on the background,,, I like the composition, but maybe i would prefer to frame the entire door of the box...', '2009-07-05 20:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
