(5560770, 803590, 106233, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea and a good light usage... I just think that the background is a little confusing, with the colored package and the black strip... maybe some less DOF would fix this...</td>', 'This is a nice idea and a good light usage... I just think that the background is a little confusing, with the colored package and the black strip... maybe some less DOF would fix this...', '2009-07-05 20:09:48.000000', NULL, 1);
